       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. P95.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 T PIC 9(3) OCCURS 8 ASCENDING KEY IS T INDEXED BY I.
       01 D PIC 9(2) OCCURS 5 DESCENDING KEY IS D INDEXED BY J.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 10 TO T(1). MOVE 25 TO T(2). MOVE 40 TO T(3).
           MOVE 55 TO T(4). MOVE 70 TO T(5). MOVE 85 TO T(6).
           MOVE 100 TO T(7). MOVE 115 TO T(8).
           SEARCH ALL T AT END DISPLAY "NF70" WHEN T(I) = 70
               DISPLAY "F70 AT " I END-SEARCH.
           SEARCH ALL T AT END DISPLAY "NF99" WHEN T(I) = 99
               DISPLAY "F99 AT " I END-SEARCH.
           SEARCH ALL T AT END DISPLAY "NF10" WHEN T(I) = 10
               DISPLAY "F10 AT " I END-SEARCH.
           SEARCH ALL T AT END DISPLAY "NF115" WHEN T(I) = 115
               DISPLAY "F115 AT " I END-SEARCH.
           MOVE 90 TO D(1). MOVE 70 TO D(2). MOVE 50 TO D(3).
           MOVE 30 TO D(4). MOVE 10 TO D(5).
           SEARCH ALL D AT END DISPLAY "NFD30" WHEN D(J) = 30
               DISPLAY "FD30 AT " J END-SEARCH.
           STOP RUN.
